4,'The shampoo is very good. The lid is a bit shaky as I\'m sure other reviews probably state but the shampoo is very good. It gets right into your scalp and works so well on all that annoying dandruff. My scalp is very dry and upset with pretty much any type of weather all year round. Currently it\'s mad at the sun and the end of summer weather. I used this and after three uses if felt and looked quite a bit better. I still have dandruff but it\'s an ongoing battle and this shampoo is really helping in the fight!<br />I would recommend giving this a shot if you are having some issues. It does help. The lid is not the best made and it can leak a little but it\'s still worth it. Just be careful with the lid.',B07ST82369,AHWCZ47A7FIYEJ7KEJG3BO3F5YXQ
