5,'I was impressed by one rightfully disgruntled reviewer\'s story about a poorly labeled box, and the ensuing responses he received. I live outside the US where paraffin baths are very uncommon, and was surprised to see them so readily available and relatively inexpensive on-line. I sold medical equipment for a while, and had a stainless-steel bath that would have been prohibitively expensive for home use. It worked wonders on my hands, both of which had seen some rough times. I recently broke a few bones in my left hand and damaged a couple of knuckles, too, so I started looking and was pleased when I found the HoMedics ParaSpa at Target for $28.99. What I don\'t understand is the price discrepancy. I don\'t know what is happening, but my son and I recently priced identical items on Amazon and his price was lower than mine by enough to raise my eyebrows. Look both ways before crossing, and compare prices before buying.',B003BQUAY6,AH4YVAFU757X2IQYUHH5M4EG4K6Q
