5,'I got these for some Chanel espadrille shoes that I got as a gift that were one size too big. Without these heel grips, my feet would get cut up and blistery from the movement of the too-big shoes. I love these! They make shoes more comfortable since the long part of the grips go on the heel and cushion the heel for more comfortable walking, and the back heel cushion gently keeps your heels in place so that there is no rubbing going on with the skin of your heel and the shoe. Both the nude textured ones and the clear gel ones are equally comfortable — in fact I put one of each in the pair of Chanel espadrilles and I could walk around all day in them. I will buy these anytime I have shoes that are too big for my feet, and I would HIGHLY recommend these to a friend!',B01N1YKVQO,AF6QC3SACPOWM5CUIEDXPUD77MOA
