4,'I have only been taking this product for a short time and it has been interesting, I was leary of buying this because of the number of reviews listed but are unable to see but I figured if it worked at all it would be worth the money. So far the ringing in my ear is still there but it is less intense at times, at times I actually have to shut every thing else out to ear it. The interesting thing is that I have arthritis in my right shoulder which is painfull enough to wake me up at night if I lay in the wrong position, that pain is gone, it went away about a week after I started takeing Synapse XT and has not returned. After reading the reviews that are availableI think this is one of those things that work for some people but not all. One other thing, I have had a slight allergic reaction which troubled me at first but my body seems to be getting use to it. I hope this is usefull to others with Tinnitus, there are many produces on the market the claim to work just keep in mind that everyone if different and may have a different experience, as I said its early and this stuff may not get rid of the ringing but time will tell.',B08LSJ6Z3H,AFDRU3OBRHCV74R7HKQCLBGNYHBQ
