4,'Let me first start by saying this is a TINY tub of pre-workout....less than half the size of a normal tub...but it\'s also half the price.  So if you think you\'re getting a deal purchasing this item, you\'ll be sorely surprised.  However, I LOVE the flavor of this pre-workout! When I received the tub, I immediately stirred some into a glass of water and took a sip. The packaging says \"Sour Gummy Bear\" but to me it has a strong sour apple flavor. It has an average caffeine content compared to other pre workouts I’ve purchased along with other essential vitamins/minerals needed for a good boost before I workout. I could not be more pleased. I did get a little “itchy\" after using this but not to the point of it being annoying. It’s just something that I expect. Great product but make sure you\'re aware of the amount you\'re getting :).',B09SQBYJQQ,AHRB277VF6RFQC2GMD457H75DNPQ
