5,'This is my second order the 1st time they only shipped in a 3pk now I got a 4 pack for about the same price. I originally ordered this product for the energy boost. Taking 1 a day I did notice a bit of an energy boost but only after the 1st month. Good enough but not what I was expecting but the one thing that others noticed that I didn\'t was the weight loss, not that I keep track or weight myself at all, then it all started making sense the belts and pants being to big and I was feeling better and the only thing I changed from my regular routine was this pill. All I can say it\'s that I feel better and have kept my weight and cholesterol down all due the acai. I have never been over weight just average but now thanks to this I am fit and feel great and I almost forgot it jumps your libido quite a bit. So I would recommend this but don\'t expect to see a change in the 1st week you have to give it a chance for at lest the 1st bottle you won\'t be disappointed.',B001RYM9XE,AGL5YWJN6R4UPG2KKIWXVH52XKFA
