5,'The first time or two that you have it, the aftertaste is a bit metallic, but you stop noticing it pretty quickly. The shakes really do fill you up, and they taste good too - having a Slimfast doesn\'t feel like a sacrifice. It\'s good to know that I can diet and reduce my caloric intake without compromising on nutritional value; this is chock-full of vitamins and minerals. Overall, this is a great way to diet or just to have a quick, easy, liquid meal. Keep in mind though that the powder doesn\'t dissolve as easily as, say, Ovaltine -- it really does need a blender to get it well-mixed. I have also used this with hot milk to make a thick, rich, hot cocoa as a meal replacement in the winter, and adding cinnamon, vanilla, and a bit of salt made it absolutely delicious! Recommended.',B001LFCZCE,AHRXR3HWHDS3T63LON4MCED7ZROQ
