5,'When you look at the soft blue light of the crystal moon in this light you will hardly be able to stay awake! It is a very soothing image to behold. I wish it had a auto-shutoff for morning light, but I knew it didn\'t have this when I bought it. I have read in consumer news that lights light this can run 24/7 for 20 cents a YEAR, and the light is supposedly garanteed for a zillion hours but I don\'t know how you would collect on that seriously. If you only plugged it in at night it should last for 5 years although I can\'t attest to this for this particular one.<br /><br />If you don\'t want a real bright glaring night light, this is for you. If you want a room partially lit so you can see where your going at night, you might want to select something brighter. In fact I think I  am going to order some of the ones that Amazon customers complained about being too bright; but this one is  a keeper for my bedroom!',B0000DJAE0,AFZL4WXHXHARWDPBUX7IK6BZZQVA
