2,'Capsules in size 2 are small enough for someone with dysphagia problems to swallow and they seem to be fine. I do have some doubts these are USA made products only because the usual statement of origin is not idiomatic US/UK english. No native speaker  says &#34;Made by USA&#34; or &#34;Made by Espana&#34; - Its always Made in USA or Made In France or wherever.  Could a US factory have a packaging manager who wasn\'t a native English speaker?  Of course, but wouldn\'t someone else in their &#34;USA factory&#34; have seen the non-standard country of origin statement on the label and pointed out the problem?<br />No one I\'ve met in business would think of allowing a potentially negative labeling issue to place their product\'s quality in doubt. My doubts lead me to believe these are Chinese made capsules, despite the &#34;Made by USA&#34; labeling.',B00D23R8MU,AETEDL4YJDJ4D7LDOETDFKNCKOKA
