5,'My father has been experiencing pain in both his knees and feet for the past 9 months. It usually hits him worse in the morning when he wakes up and his feet cramps up very badly till he\'s unable to move. He has trouble climbing the stairs as well and can no longer go jogging and enjoy his long walks in the park. It\'s really painful for me to see him no longer able to enjoy doing the things he love. We tried everything, from physiotherapy to traditional medicine and all kinds of expensive supplements, but their effects only lasted for a short while, after a few weeks, he would feel the pain again. We first heard about Regenerix Gold from a friend and were apprehensive at first. But after she raved about how effective it was, we thought we would give it a try. Anyway, its just an 80 dollars investment! I\'m so happy we took that leap of faith and didnt give up trying. REGENERIX GOLD is indeed AMAZING! My father felt better in 2 weeks! We were still cautious thinking the effect wouldnt last but he\'s on his second bottle now and FINALLY he\'s back on his feet walking in the park and playing with his grandchildren. Words cant express how happy we all are to finally see how much he has improved thanks to Regenerix Gold. We\'re definitely recommending this to all our other friends!',B00M64QTGW,AGHANXX4O4JSLVWM2HCXEJHZ6GSQ
