5,'This oil has a mild scent to it. It\'s what I think of as a classic baby smell. I think it\'s lovely.<br /><br />I don\'t really use baby oil for my skin(other than for insect repellant), since I don\'t care for the oiliness it leaves behind, but I like to have it around. It\'s handy! It\'s a main ingredient for many \"doughs/sands/slimes\", which my children(and myself) like to play with. The scent of it is relaxing. It\'s also great at removing sticky things, like gum and stickers, and for removing paint from brushes and hands.',B079PCMQVC,AGSM75HHGVYI263VKMFQMK6GJQ7A
