5,'This is a set of blades and respective covers for Philips Norelco Shavers series 8XXX and 9XXX (not for the series 9XXX Prestige line, though). Not only does it fit perfectly, aptly replacing the blades and covers in the shaver head assembly, it looks practically identical to the original name brand.<br />I appreciate that they include the cleaner brush, too. When traveling, the brush can be easily lost/misplaced. (Hate to admit that I even lose the brush at home, too.)  So, having extra brushes is a definite plus.<br />Tested these in my Norelco Series 8900 electric rotary shaver. It performed very well, delivering a very credible shave.  I hope that it will equal the name brand in terms of durability. However, that assessment will be based on time and usage.<br />I would say that it gives a decent shave, though not as close and smooth as the name brand product. However, it\'s an economical alternative and will deliver a shave that will suffice for most needs. I feel this product lives up to the descriptions. 4.5 stars.',B0B9KDKN95,AHPGHDFIU3BUB3RQBP56RQQA7W4Q
