4,'I just got my tube, and was pleased with the design of the package.  It is easy open for the kids, and the paste itself is sparkly.  It makes your mouth tingle as you use it, so you know which areas you need to get better.  Best of all I had just eaten blueberries, and the toothpaste completely got rid of remaining color, and left my teeth looking as good as a dentist cleaning.  Rather than a lingering mint taste, there is just a clean feeling...and a bit of remaining tingle in my tongue around my piercing.<br /><br />All in all, for first use I would say this is one of the best products I have ever tried.',B001JJ69RE,AG6CNQ5WF7XASTBT2OHXAOC4JZEQ
