4,'This is a review for MISSION Max Chill Massage Roller which at time of review runs $19.99. This is a pretty clever design- it is basically 3 parts, the ball, and the base which the top twists off to release the ball and put in the freezer. The base is nice as it will keep your hands from freezing and helps control the ball while massaging/applying cold. The ball will tolerate light to medium-light pressure and the cold is long lasting and wonderful when you need it. The base is rather large and not a problem for me to handle having larger hands- but it is something for others to consider! I think this roller is pretty amazing.',B09FQDX2ST,AHCEDKGE26XM7BF3R6FST5FH6K4A
