5,'This is the [[ASIN:B004699FX4 Kespon Guard ID Roller Refill, 0.13-Ounce (Pack of 2)]] for the Kesspon ID Guard Plus.  The design is flawless pre-inked rollers are changed without ever touching the roller / ink, the holder covers the roller when not in use, and the holder protects you from getting ink on your fingers; Great design.  The rolls fit into [[ASIN:B0042Y6MDO Kespon Guard Your ID Roller Stamp in Pink]],  [[ASIN:B0042YC62K Green]], [[ASIN:B0042YBOY6 Blue]], and [[ASIN:B0045JSQQW White]].  This product reduces the time I spend shreading by only having to cover account numbers, personally identifable data and frees me up to do other tasks.  This is not a shreader replacement but if you get as many credit card offers and other such junk mail as I do this item makes quick work of blocking your personally identifable information.  Now you can bring in magazines to the office for others to read and erase your address in one pass.  In most situations I found one pass was fine but feel free to make a second or third pass to ensure your personal information is kept that way.',B004699FX4,AHTDOZDG5QWB42URSXRH2ZX5KG4A
