4,'Arrived in a 1oz bottle. Put it in amber glass thereafter. Blood looks very dark red/brown and rubs on the color yellow but turns dark brown. It will stay on your skin for hours unless you wash it off so do not use before going out. The taste is almost non-existent but makes teeth feel very good when used orally. Has virtually no smell. Not really sure why people were complaining about that. Used on a mosquito bite and seemed to take away the pain in about 2 minutes. Would recommend oregano for mosquito bites also for those who like natural remedies.  Used it on inflamed skin and within 1 hour noticed a difference.  Kind of shocking how powerful this stuff is. Will write an update upon further use.',B00MG2CX7I,AEF37V7R7NMZEACJME7G6MCZLC6A
