5,'This was the only way I could figure out how to try ALL of the Java Monsters.  You pay a premium here, but I haven\'t been able to locate a full multi pack anywhere else.  So... I finally broke down and paid the premium.  Worth it if you really like these to find your favorite flavors.  The Irish and Vanilla light are probably my least favorite.  You can find Mean Bean and Moca Java pretty consistently (Mean Bean is a favorite).  The Salted Caramel is also excellent.  Kona\'s not bad.  Either way, this purchase was worth it for me to able to try all the flavors.  It\'s the only time I\'ll do it, but worth it.  If that\'s your goal, do this.  Otherwise, this probably isn\'t the best value for your money.',B00NYCSVHK,AF3VJPHY7NFUS5APZXGS2ER55GCA
