5,'Produspa Revolushine Styling 3 in 1 Hair Care Hot Combo has become my new best friend. I have to say that I am a little hesitant when trying new things that state that they are going to cut your routine down. After hearing that it takes me a while to warm up to anything, this product does not have that problem. It has easy instructions, the lcd is easy to read and understand. If you do not want it on Celsius you can change it to Fahrenheit just by holding the (+) and (-) at the same time. This is a great product and works like a charm. I will be getting a few more as gifts because I want others to know how much this is going to help them in their routine and get the same if not better results for their current products. I know that I am getting better results than my other products.',B01AINKGES,AGUBPHP2VOICK7UOBVQW32DFCXTA
