3,'I didn\'t have any issues with the softgels sticking together like other reviewers. The pills look about identical to what I\'ve bought at Walmart and Target in the past.<br /><br />I\'m docking two stars though because the product images are obviously computer renderings instead of photos of the actual product. The actual bottle is a thin, cheap feeling plastic with a white lid and a label sticker slapped on it.<br /><br />Why is this a big deal? A few reasons:<br /><br />1) Amazon doesn\'t allow renderings for product images. Companies are required to use REAL photos of their products. I don\'t like rule breakers.<br /><br />2) I absolutely hate not getting exactly what I ordered. The product images show a premium looking vitamin bottle, something you\'d feel comfortable giving to a health nut as a gift. Instead of getting that bottle, I got a junky bottle that is lower quality than the locally available store brands.<br /><br />3) A vitamin is a vitamin. It is unlikely that Brand A is going to be substantially different than Brand B. The only things that make one vitamin product stand out from another are the price and the packaging. I can get vitamin D3 cheaper locally and in a better bottle.<br /><br />This product was provided at a discounted price in exchange for my honest review.',B015BQ5Y1W,AHWWEEJR7P4GKHX36SR3WV2C3R3A
1,'My kid is 34 pounds. She wasn’t hard on it. There’s no hole to repair with a repair kit, it just leaks and quickly enough it won’t hold pressure for sensory. Waste of money',B0B58YJPYM,AHWVAHK7H3ZWTQ52LPE6V2OUVB4A
3,'I purchased this device directly from manufacture.<br /><br />Be careful to not let the electrodes touch each other or any conductive material (e.g. metal).<br />The electrodes are connected directly to the batteries, and there is no shut off switch<br />or fuse (AFAICS) between the electrodes and the batteries.<br /><br />The device consists of:<br />1. Plastic body containing an ultrasonic fogger and a glass jar.<br />2. Plastic cap containing two 12V A23 batteries and electrode holders.<br />3. AC 24VDC @ 1Amp ultrasonic fogger transformer.<br />4. Scrub pad to clean electrodes.<br /><br />The device DOES NOT include silver rod electrodes, which are purchased separately.<br /><br />To assemble device:<br />1. Press the angle cut end of thinner electrode into silver colored electrode holder on bottom of cap.<br />2. Press the angle cut end of the thicker electrode into the gold colored electrode holder on bottom of cap.<br />3. BE EXTREMELY CAREFUL TO NOT ALLOW THE ELECTRODES TO TOUCH EACH OTHER OR ANY CONDUCTIVE MATERIAL (E.G. METAL).<br />4. Download IONX Timer app or use some other timer.<br /><br />To operate the device:<br />1. Remove glass jar from plastic body.<br />2. Instructions say to add 50 ml (I think actually 30 ml or 1 oz) of ice cold water to body to submerge ultrasonic<br />  fogger with water.  It is very important use ICE COLD water to prevent the ultrasonic fogger from overheating.<br />  Using distilled water will make the ultrasonic fogger last much longer.<br />3. Add 4 oz of distilled water to glass jar.<br />  I HAVE READ IT IS IMPORTANT TO USE DISTILLED WATER  (OR PERHAPS REVERSE OSMOSIS WATER)<br />  TO REDUCE CHANCE OF AGRARIA (BLUE SKIN).<br />4. Put glass jar into plastic body and make certain there is no air between bottom.<br />  of glass jar and top of ultrasonic fogger.<br />5. Plug in ultrasonic fogger.<br />6. Start timer.<br />7. Put cap on top of body causing the  electrodes to go into the glass jar with water.<br />8. When timer finishes, remove the cap from the body.<br />9. THE DEVICE DOES NOT AUTOMATICALLY SHUT OFF, IT IS VERY IMPORTANT TO REMOVE THE CAP WHEN THE TIMER FINISHES.<br /><br />Notes:<br />1. The ultrasonic fogger does not function until it is submerged underwater.<br />  The ultrasonic fogger LEDs will be red until it starts functioning.<br />  After it is submerged, the ultrasonic fogger LEDs will turn blue color<br />  and amber color.<br />2. As the batteries weaken, the batches will be lower ppm',B00TY29HHM,AERIHVMPRLLQVZNF7LAUETZ7G32A
