5,'I was part of the crowd funding campaign for Headoc. They sent me the finished product a few months ago, but I was too busy to try it. Today my TMJ (jaw & behind the ear pain) was so bad that I decided to give it a go. Snapping on that cosmetic cap deal that was included in the box, I applied cream to my face & neck, cranked up the vibration & warm red light and moved the headoc in small circular motions across my face, adjacent to my ear, under my chin, on my neck, behind my ear. It was extraordinarily relaxing, gliding effortlessly with the cream across my skin. It felt like a soothing upscale salon facial. I didn\'t want to stop. After a few minutes I put it down & OMG, no-more-pain! I think I\'ll actually get some sleep tonight! :) Thank you development team! Thank you crowd funding team! Thank you for a non-surgical, drug free treatment for the unbearable TMJ pain.',B01DMFI5A6,AFRGKWXLYLGNIDAX7W7JNTFBEWKA
