4,'I have planters fasciitis.  I have prescription custom insoles I use, but wanted a spare pare as sometimes I don\'t get them swapped out between shoes.  I liked that these could be trimmed for a custom fit.  I carefully trimmed them to be just larger than my foot. They have nice trimming lines on the bottom side to help guide you, though I did go with the shape of my foot over the lines in areas where there were variations.  The insoles fit into my tennis shoes nicely.  They are thicker than my custom insoles and do not fit well in my work/dress shoes.  However, I really wanted these for my tennis shoes and they work great for them.  They are comfortable and do help my feet with the arch support they provide.  I plan to just leave these in my tennis shoes and put my other pair in whatever work shoes I am wearing each day.<br /><br />Disclaimer: I received this product at a discounted rate in exchange for my honest review of the product. The opinions in the review are my own based on my experience with the product.',B00PR39Z6A,AE5A7WA4S662TABVBPWOOR4OWEVA
