5,'It\'s been a year since I bought this and it\'s truly a miracle worker. My feet get so bad between flip flops, mud, drying out, etc. I like to use this remover before I shower: put the gel on (while wearing gloves), let sit for a minute, then go to town with my colossal foot file (also bought in Amazon) and the dead skin comes off like a paste. Super gross, super satisfying. I always wash my feet really well after, then slather a thick cream, and cover with hospital-type socks over night. Here I waited several months between so I didn\'t get everything but typically I do it once a month and my feet are completely smooth and blemish free. If you haven\'t tried this, buy it! You won\'t regret it!',B00ZNQC9LE,AGVJSQTLTWKQMAX5MQLDTU2LTSEQ
