3,'This is a pretty good unit.  I like that it has a cell presence.  No matter where dad may roam, we have a chance of him being safe.  The people at the service are nice, but they\'ve got some work to do.  First, there\'s a feature called \"Find Name\" you just text \"Find Name\" with the first name of your loved one and it texts you back a map showing where they are.  HOWEVER, if it can\'t find the person because they\'re in a cell-inaccessible location like a basement of a hospital or something, it just sends you a map of the last place you located them.  I would rather it just said it didn\'t know where he was.  This is a software issue.  All they\'d have to do is make it more pro-active where it reported its location more often.  Pretty simple actually!  Also, the company should have some additional hardware like buttons we could put down low in case dad falls and doesn\'t have his unit on.<br />Dad doesn\'t complain about the weight, but it does bang against things regularly.  This triggers the fall alarm.  Fortunately, it asks him if he\'s okay before it sends the alarm.  He can cancel it by pushing the button.  It\'s not really loud, so there\'s another thing that could be improved.<br /><br />Update: As I mentioned, the locate feature is wildly inconsistent.  I discovered that the company is even worse.  I told them to remove this charge and I didn\'t notice they didn\'t until my credit card expired.  I know, that\'s my responsibility, but it\'s a small amount so I didn\'t notice.  I went to update my account online and you can\'t.  What kind of tech company doesn\'t have an online payment / account management interface?  So I cancelled the account.  Go with a better company!',B07G9MTFX8,AGFCAGUEWVWLIJSOXDTXFZE6YVJA
5,'I found out about the Vitra-tox products when I got a colonic.  Same product different commercial label.  My results were amazing!!!  All the build up in my colon came out.  I couldn\'t believe it what I was seeing.  then I would go do a colonic each night.  I saw more bowel movements at home during the day but I was glad to get the colonics.  Then my skin started to clear up.  I had the worse acne. I didn\'t get hungry during the week long detox, slept like a baby and had energy.  I also had an apple shape body after I had surgery for a torn ACL and because of the surgery and drugs my lymphatic system was all clogged.  My stomach went completely down....even my husband noticed which is huge!!  It was better than getting Lypo!!  When my big belly went down then is when I realized how much I need to do this.....at least once a year.  Unfortunately this vendor has raised their prices, it\'s still worth it.  Try to watch the videos on Sonne\'s website to see exactly how to use the powder.  Someone said in a review she was choking.  if she was choking she was TOTALLY not using it properly.  I highly recommend using R.W. KNUDSEN organic apple juice.  Pour the juice into a shaker, then the detox liquid, stir, then quickly add the powder and shake like crazy for a few seconds and down it as fast as you can.  EAsy peasy.<br /><br />just think about this for a minute.  think of all the food you eat on a daily basis, vitamins, etc and how long your body takes to break it all down.....all of that is in your colon.....for years!  Get this!!  Thank me later',B000IRIFES,AFVV7L5IIKYNV335P5SSN3DTU7MA
