2,'I\'ve owned my Toto Washlet Portable Bidet for three years, and used it daily at home and travel. When comparing the Bio Bidet, consider the warranty, the issues with batteries and electrical connections, and the general mechanics of the system inside compared with the Toto. Essentially, and I am sure that Bio Bidet will agree with this - is that the Bio Bidet intended on copying the unique features of the Toto Washlet Portable Bidet, and offer it at a lower cost. Fact is that the Toto Washlet is quite expensive, and that is their business strategy. So the Bio Bidet offers a lower cost.<br /><br />However! Guess what? There is new portable bidet technology that can be purchased on Amazon.com that is much much better than both the Toto and Bio Bidet. It\'s the Hygienna Solo.<br /><br />No batteries needed! It is discreet. It is portable. It doesn\'t break when it might fall like the Toto. It offers much more water power. It\'s amazing. Breakthrough fluids technology and it now makes both the Toto Portable Washlet and the Bio Bidet the distant past.<br /><br />Check it out on Amazon and compare the features. You can use pretty much any drinking water bottle. Amazing. Goodbye Toto Washlet and Bio Bidet once you find out about the Hygienna Solo.',B0047ADEBQ,AGKCQI52C3ZUWOSHCIGSQK2OYO2A
