5,'Jumped over to using washcloths last year after using gross loafas most of my life. Started with the highly regarded japanese salux washcloth. I enjoyed it until it made my skin sensitive & irritated it after constant usage (would use it at least 5 times a week.) I decided to order this as I knew I had to try different products, as my skin couldn\'t handle the salux cloth.<br /><br />Although they serve the same purpose and look like they\'d perform the same ; the material used & the way it\'s built with the bigger openings haven\'t irritated or hurt my skin like the salux has! & it does the job perfectly in terms of exfoliation. No residue or redness. I love it :)<br /><br />Very pleased over the fact that I can continue using washcloths without issue anymore. I decided to give my sister one as it came as a pack of 3, she loves it as too! Will return in a few months when I have to replace these. Thank you.',B09C5FSLRL,AHINTKF5KZQWNOBR62O4YWD723ZA
