5,'Nothing beats a hot bubble bath after a long day of work. I have a Jacuzzi bath tub. I enjoy bubble baths from time to time. Mostly I use liquid form bubble bath. I found that this bubble bath powder works just  as well. Once I turn on the Jacuzzi, I don\'t need a lot, just a couple of caps. There will be a lot of bubbles. The water becomes smooth, to a point that it is a little bit slippery. The lavender scent is very soothing. This is just a great bubble bath product. I really enjoy it.',B0876GXM2L,AERBXNFQCS5OD6LJOIXMRDPTOVHQ
