5,'I recently started the power 90 workout program and needed a body tape to keep track of my progress. The myotape is an excellent instrument that does the job in a quite fanciful way. No manual came with the package which would have been useful. I will try to explain how it works, since some reviewers had difficulty in utilizing the myotape.<br /><br />First, pull on the tape and circumvent your waistline; make it as loose as possible, leaving enough space to fit your hand between your stomach and the tape. In the product picture there is a pocket where you can hook the tape extremity you just pulled; insert it in the pocket. Once completed there is a button below the symbol \"MYOTAPE\". Press it. It will retract the tape, tightening it around your waist. Make sure the tape is nicely snugged around the outermost part of your stomach, and use a mirror in order to read the measurement.<br /><br />I would recommend this tape to anyone who wants a fancy body tape. But on serious note, a singer tape measure is just as efficient in my opinion. $4 vs $10. You make the call.',B000G7YW7Y,AFLIEZ5JC3FIZDZ7CJCUUL72PHPA
