5,'Been a Wilson blade man for some 40 years now and was ecstatic when I found out the Wilson Custom Shop was back in business making forged clubs.  Last summer I ordered a set of Wilson Staff Tour 100\'s custom made to my specification and have to say these are the finest clubs I have ever played.<br /><br />Perfectly balanced, great feel, and \"without a doubt\" ... the best looking blades I have ever seen.<br /><br />The confidence they instill reminds me of my first set of Staff\'s back in the 70\'s, I am able to conjure up an execute shots like in a dream.<br />Stingers off the tee, knock down 3 irons, draws, high fades, bump and runs, divot digs, low spin, high spin ... there only limitation is your imagination. Don\'t neglect to purchase the gap wedge ... its a madman ... flops, chops, and long sandy\'s at will. The only thing missing is a 2 iron, and I plan to have one custom made for me in the near future.<br /><br />These are not your grandaddy\'s blades, if you\'re a feel golfer like me,  you owe it to yourself to get a grip on a set of these 21st Century Wilson Tour 100\'s.',B00L4ML9TE,AGX5SUVIWXOOAS4RAYHMATVJHBKA
