5,'I wasn\'t sure this would be sufficient for a deep clean at such a low price point. I\'m glad I gave it a try! Three heads (one for sensitive/dry skin, one for normal/oily skin one for makeup removal.<br />The heads are easy to change. An audible click let\'s you know the head is attached appropriately.<br />I love the pink! There is a handy stand for storage and a USB charger that I plugged into my wall cell phone charger.<br />I have never used a fancy brush to clean my face before and I thoroughly enjoyed the experience. I have very sensitive skin. I thought both brushes felt pretty soft so today I used the white and gray brush for normal skin and my face is quite tender. I\'ll stick to the white softer brush from now on!<br />When I was a young girl I used to scrub my face with Dial soap and a washcloth and felt that my skin was really clean! Now, I understand that was very bad for my skin and I haven\'t found tool or scrub that felt like it had really cleaned my skin since. Using this fantastic brush remindse of the two step microderm abrasion kit sold by Mary Kay! My skin is soft as a baby\'s bottom and feels tingly and clean.<br />This brush removes makeup, sweat, dirt and old skin cells!<br />Give this product a try!',B07R3ZJZCT,AEUS2ZTYF6GMVQKXL3MCGH5OQZBQ
