5,'My husband and I decided to choose our own gifts this year for Christmas.  Our tub was recently refinished and we can no longer use epsom salts in it or they could damage the new finish, so I wanted a foot bath I could use epsom salts in. Epsom salts absorb through the skin and help you relax and I missed being able to use them in the bath. I did not want a foot bath with bubbles or other &#34;features&#34; that could possibly stop working/break, especially since epsom salts could build up in any kind of mechanical components. I like the simplicity of this one. Nice and deep, shaped for feet (unlike a normal bucket), easy to clean out and seems pretty sturdy. The color is nice too. I wear a woman\'s size 7-7.5 shoe and I find this bucket to be very roomy. May not be the size of a bathtub, but I still feel some of the positive effects of the epsom salts just soaking my feet and ankles in this, so I\'m happy.',B002XBV78S,AHNJKUBATA7SNJ2BOGCAGVPXVGWQ
