5,'I started using this about two weeks ago and I can definitely tell a difference in my sleeping.  I am past menopause and feel like I haven\'t slept in three years.  The doctor offered to have some hormones compounded for me but the price was outrageous.  I found this on Amazon and like the fact that it is a natural cream.  My sister died of breast cancer years ago and it was hormonal related so want to stay away from anything that is not natural.  I use this in the morning and at night.  You use just a dime size and rub it into your skin.  The jar should last a while.  If it keeps working as well as it is now I will most definitely purchase it again.',B019TDGPN4,AHB6CQG4TEZGSPPVQKE63BJA5VCQ
