4,'I bought this product because I can\'t stand the loud ads and previews in movie theaters before the movie I want to see commences.  I used to use foam earplugs but didn\'t like the muffled effect of sound.  These earplugs don\'t muffle as much of the sounds I want to hear but they don\'t block loud, booming sounds as much either (they are supposed to be more selective than foam by letting the &#34;good&#34; sound in and blocking the &#34;bad&#34; sound out, but I\'m not so sure this is the case).  The size is about as small as I can handle in the darkness of a movie theater.  (I worry that I may drop one and never find it.)<br /><br />My wife tried these and didn\'t like them at all.  She complained that they don\'t fit in her ears because she has small ear canals.',B00A3Z44R2,AFCH5RWFF6MOJC726X7QKJXZA32A
