5,'I like the compact size of this flosser...everything was neatly packaged, it has a handy tip compartment on the top lid and it comes with a nice travel bag. Initially after using it 3 times, I wasn\'t impressed but not sure if it was properly seated. Now the cord on the handle isn\'t very long and it doesn\'t stretch easily since it\'s coiled for storage (I slightly have to bend down while using over the sink and I\'m only 5\"7\").<br />I wish the placement of the tip release button was in a different as I\'ve pressed it while in use causing the tip to come out while using, but I\'m getting accustomed to that now. Finally, I\'m happy with the water pressure and is how I anticipated the water pressure to be as intense on the highest setting to the point where I have to lower it.<br /><br />I highly recommend this flosser rather than paying twice as much for a Waterpik. Overall, it\'s a nice product!',B08XQ8S6ZM,AEU23D77GMHDJW4OW3NO377SILWQ
