5,'Not only is this a great gift considering what we are going through with our elected &#34;pu**y grabber&#34; in chief, but it comes beautifully packaged and all ready for gift giving!<br /><br />I can only hope this amazing company starts a whole line to get me through the next 3 years... &#34;Because De Voss&#34; &#34;Because Jared&#34; and the list goes on and on.<br /><br />Great product - definitely a must for the rational people in your life!',B077BF7K8B,AEBHTYHJI73F5EFWDKEIRBWB2VEA
5,'***Full Disclosure*** I was given a coupon code to make the purchase of them all but free. I would not have purchased these ear plugs otherwise.<br /><br />That being said, there is no way I could give these anything other that 5 stars. There are options for every situation and ear type.<br /><br />The moldable silicon plugs will probably get the least amount of use, they reduce moderate noises to quiet, but that is their limit. They also effectively clean the wax out of your ears if you don\'t do it before they are inserted. I don\'t usually wear hearing protection in a situation where there isn\'t dust or dirt, so I don\'t see them lasting long because they are sticky and will become filthy to the point of not wanting to put them in my ears.<br /><br />The dark green ones fit great in my right ear canal, but they slowly slip out of my left because it\'s much smaller. It\'s not designed for a canal as small as I apparently have. Quiets the noise drastically in the right side though.<br /><br />The blue ones are easily the most comfortable. The \'stem\' is a little long, so if I were to wear them while sleeping I would surely trim it back a little to avoid pressure on the stem while sleeping on my side. For sleeping they would probably make it impossible to wake up to an alarm.<br /><br />The orange ones are my favorite, they do everything I think an earplug should. They fit deep into either of my ears, they don\'t work their out and they cut the noise of my mower to a gentle hum. The rigid plastic insert makes insertion easier and offers better purchase for removal. They also didn\'t bother my ears at all in the he hour I was mowing and trimming my lawn. I even left them in when I came inside so I wouldn\'t have to listen to my kids screaming.<br /><br />All of the pairs having their own little case is another plus, no more picking lint off a plug before putting it in.<br /><br />I think it\'s safe to say that these will satisfy 99\% of people who buy them.',B07MZHT6HJ,AFKSX4JSNNK6YRP262VAZV3DFVYA
5,'I would highly recommend this quality solid cedar Chinese foot soaking tub for a truly wonderful experience. Your feet will thank you no matter what their size!',B00I149FHG,AHUBNG3774Y6UQ7PWR2MNLIVKOAQ
4,'MagSRT provides a higher dose than other available slow release formulas, and avoids the digestive distress that can be associated with regular release versions. However, given the cost, I would not recommend this as a first line magnesium supplement - try a regular release version, then a lower dose slow release if needed, and use this only if you require both the slow release and the higher dose.<br /><br />This version of MagSrt also provides B vitamin supplementation (B6, B12, Folate), which they say enhances absorption of the magnesium. The evidence for this is quite thin - some limited in vitro studies, but no in vivo human trials with positive results that I\'m aware of. That said, there\'s no particular problem with the B vitamins being in the mix, except you may be taking something you don\'t need. Jigsaw does offer a B vitamin free version (MagSRT B Free), although the cost is the same.<br /><br />The pills are large, but not absurd (as some supplements can be), and have a uniquely smooth coating that makes them easy to get down. They have no particular odor or taste and no aftertaste. They can be split cleanly with a pill cutter, although I don\'t know what impact this has on absorption.<br /><br />Four stars for quality, one off because of the cost. A years worth, at the recommended dose (4 pills/day) is over $250.',B00N7431MU,AGYOCHD3LSESEB6V7WNGCBUAAA3A
