5,'My biggest concerns with most of the teeth whitener products out there is that they are all artificially sweetened and full of unnecessary chemicals, which is a disaste for anyone sensitiver to have to use every day.  And for someone like me, who has been health-conscious and completely off of sugar for over two decades, due to a tendency to hypoglycemia, I wondered if I would EVER find a healthy alternative for whitening my teeth. I have to say that I finally found something healthy, that works easily and beautifully without any unhealthy effects.<br /><br />If you care for your body\'s well being, as well as your teeth,THIS IS THE RIGHT STUFF!! It\'s healthy, and for me, usable any and every day without worries aboud blood sugar or nasty chemicals. AND I saw whitening results from the very FIRST application!!  My search is over. I am already delighted with the ease and the results of this whitening pen. I will be back for more. Thank you for making this!!',B00C8U19MS,AHFTAGYEDYFN3QGDX3J5UIXFNAIA
