2,'1st, the concept of a giant day pill organizer was a dream. After filling the organizer, I was  challenged with removing the pills. Traditionally if you remove pills from a compartment, you open the hatch and dump them out. These areas do not have hatches or lids. So I used a tiny spoon to scoop them out, but a few of the pills always flipped into another compartment and I didn’t know which pills or into which compartment. Also there are two small plastic snaps that secure the lid. One broke within days. The quality of the box (minus the closures) is good. So I’m keeping it for some possible future use. I cannot recommend this as pill box AT ALL.  If they can improve on the clasps, maybe it’s a nice box for something else.',B09C7ZG3ZK,AHJC3K2RATHD42BK43CF27XTWDEQ
