5,'This toner has changed my skin care routine in the most positive way imaginable. I had always heard of women using toners and such but I just always thought it was for acne prone skin for some reason. I used to have a habit of getting vitamin E capsules and busting them to put the gel on my face. I hated the greasy sticky feeling so I stopped.<br /><br />This toner makes my skin feel so rejuvenated, clean, invigorated, hydrated, and moisturized and all even before putting moisturizer!!! My skin now looks amazing with my makeup on and feels so smooth. The feeling is soft yet not greasy, sticky, or gross.<br /><br />I have even been noticing it helping with allergy bumps and other skin issues on my face. It isn\'t an overnight clean face but it is slowly getting better especially after trying many different skin masks and exfoliates without any type of result so I am extremely happy to see my skin clearing up with the use of this product. I will continue to use this product because I now see that it is a NEED for my skin care routine.<br /><br />I was offered this item at a  discount or free for testing and review purposes, all words are my own, I was not paid in any way.',B00WQAM3M0,AFMBGOYICCYE4XASV3QKDB3CEFAQ
