5,'I didn\'t do a whole lot of biking before and I wasn\'t concerned about its effect on my ears. Now with a bit louder bike I got concerned and tried DownBeats.<br /><br />It fits in my ears perfectly and since the stem is relatively short, the helmet doesn\'t push it in or out. I wore the earplugs for 2 hours the longest and I didn\'t find them uncomfortable at all but this may change on a real long trip.<br /><br />About the sound: I hear the traffic perfectly, I don\'t have a separated-off, fishtank feeling and on the other hand the noise of the bike and the wind are nicely reduced. I think I will try something else which promises even better noise reduction but i like this one too.<br /><br />+1 for the sturdy case, I couldn\'t imagine a better fit for a bike.',B00A3Z44R2,AE7B3B3MRCXCULB5USMR7XAYPQOQ
