1,'fast response,easy to wear around my neck or in my pocket,I put it on the charger every other day  Want to add what happened to me,my button started to have to be pressed several times and then I could not have any response, when the operator checked the item it was not working and they said it was this area, so I had to return the parts to get a refund, it cost me over $11. to return the item. That was approx. a month ago and no refund has been issued.',B07G9MTFX8,AG3HAN5BZJYV2MZUS7LJPX25IXIA
5,'I was skeptical about using this hair straightener.  Was not sure it would work with thick Afro American hair, but it does. The comb is corded/swivel and is long enough to reach across my vanity to get to my mirror and is easy to manage. The handle has grips for firm control of the comb.  The comb gets hot enough to send off smoke.  I was shocked that it got my hair really straight. I have purchased many hair products that did not get hot enough to straighten my hair. The flashing light lets you know it\'s heating up and turns solid when it\'s ready.  The control buttons are located on the back of the product and are easy to use... It didn\'t take long to get hot and ready to use... And automatically shut off after periods of non-use.<br /><br />The comb and instructions are the only things in the package.  The ceramic comb teeth are surrounded by plastic to prevent getting burned.  I was able to get close to my edges and did not get burned.  I am satisfied with my comb and recommend it to others.<br /><br />I received the product for a reduced fee in return for my unbiased opinion.  The views expressed in this review at my own unbiased honest opinion of this product and was not compensated in any way for it',B01FNZKXTO,AFPW6X33XXATFSPDJEOKEZ4BJKMQ
