4,'Ordered this for my wife\'s carpal tunnel symptoms. We wrap up her hands and wrists at night in splint to keep them straight. These are your standard elastic wraps, nothing special to report. They work, don\'t lose elasticity after the first few uses the way some brands do, and it\'s 5yds long which is nice because dealing with bandages that are too short is a pain. The only down side is the little clips to hold the wrap to itself. They are standard fare for most wraps but are still annoying. But I don\'t think you can find an elastic bandage with Velcro for this price. Overall I\'m satisfied.<br /><br />This is an honest review in exchange for a free product (&lt;$10 value) from this company',B075JL2PYV,AFCIFVTL6HQZYPP7RXPFDI6YYBCA
