4,'This product is great. I was skeptical at first and even dud some research on the product. I wasn\'t sure what yacon root did. This is what I learned:<br /><br />Yacon is a South American plant that grows high in the Andes mountains of South America. Syrup extracted from the root of the yacon looks like molasses and tastes a bit like sweet maple syrup.  The root is a soluble fiber that helps people feel full, New York nutritionist Lisa Drayer said, adding that yacon contributes few calories because it passes through the body undigested.<br />I won\'t used this product for a week but have shed 3 pounds already. The most important thing is I feel better. I got this product when it was discounted and I\'m glad I did. I will be purchasing this item again and recommend it to anyone interested in weight loss and feeling better.',B010OEYYQC,AGB5TJ6KD3N3QYASJZVA5GGQ2IOA
