5,'All I can say is WOW! I ordered this for a friend who has limited mobility issues and cannot bend to put their shoes on. This shoe horn is really nice. Definitely nicest one I\'ve ever seen. The horn itself is some type of metal that has a smooth painted finish on it. The handle part has a very soft padding on it and the telescoping sections are easy to extend and collapse. I was glad I had read a couple of reviews that mentioned you need to every so slightly rotate each section in order to lock them in place. There wasn\'t any instructions included, so I\'m glad someone wrote how to do it in they review. For $12 this was probably the buy of the year! It\'s nice too that it collapses, so it can be packed in a suitcase, but extends long enough to help people who can\'t bend. Thanks. Zero regrets. This is just perfect for the person i bought it for! And they loved it.',B083DJP4DW,AHGXCSMYATSFHFXBWW5FVL4F4HEQ
