3,'I have terrible scars on my skin and thought I would try this out to see if it worked. I have tried just about everything else...including the expensive stuff. This was at my local grocery store (it\'s their brand) and was on a super introduction sale so I got this and the eye serum. The smell is OK, nothing fantastic but nothing foul either. It is very runny in consistency, even after shaking to mix it all up so be careful about doing so without the cap on and when dispensing it. As far as its ability, this didn\'t work for me and I did not notice any difference at all. I am giving it 3 stars because even though it didn\'t fade the spots, it also didn\'t cause me to break out like many other products have. I have not given up on it yet. I am considering a derma roller to use while I apply this to see if the deeper penetration into the scarring helps fade it out.<br /><br />If anyone else can offer up suggestions for old, deep, and stubborn scarring, please let me know. The scars are embarrassing but because most of them are on my neck, I end up with makeup on my shirts as a result of covering them up with concealer.',B01CKH1SNI,AHWKHVFVMJ44PSPGDCFKOQCJNIBA
