5,'I looooove this product. It is not a steamer for room. It is exactly for the face and for this exact purpose it works great. With one load of water it produce steam for 20 minutes or so. It is exactly appropriate time for steaming the face. If you cover your head and the machine under a towel when it is steaming, it will work as a great spa. I also love the needles for extracting pores. I don\'t  have large pores but even for my small pores there are some applicators that works great. Most of the applicators that I have used before were so painful to use. but these ones are not. I want to use it every 2 weeks because even when I am not in my Venus week ;) and my hormones are not in he best conditions of the month,  using the whole package makes my skin clear and glowy with small and clean pores. I think every girl has to have one of them at home. :)',B07KC4Z47V,AGTWCUJJKQDQXE7JW5C6H5JC47YA
