5,'This has really helped with the stye’s in my eyes. I had about 2 on the rim of my upper eye lid and one on the rim of my lower eye lid. And I had a couple of styes on my other eye too. I used to apply this oil 2-3 times a day with a Q Tip. After going through a couple of bottles I found they had all disappeared one after the other over a period of 1-2 months. No side effects nothing',B06Y4WY962,AH4FIGI6XKPM3OA46HH2X4N7OQ6A
