5,'I had to come back and write a review. I am in awe of this product! I\'ve had 3 chalazions in my right eye and 1 in my left eye for almost 2 years. i hate them and have tried everything from salt water, apple cider and tea trea oil. none of them did anything. Goodbye Styes was my last resort before i decided on the surgery but this really really worked. ive been using it for almost a week and the chalazions are much smaller, come down to the size of a small little whitehead under my eyelid. i am so grateful that i tried this. what a great birthday gift to get rid of these things before so i can have great pictures. Whew! this is a liquid miracle.',B06Y4WY962,AEW6FBS3BQ4P67FPN6PXLFD2SZCQ
