5,'I am always very skeptical about Vitamin C products - usually, they do not last long, or have issues with how effective they are due to being in unstable formulas.  Or if they\'re one of the good ones that are stable, they are very very expensive.  What makes this serum amazing is that it\'s stable (but easy to keep in the frig if you want to make sure it stays extra fresh), it has a lovely silky texture that makes it suitable for either applying alone under a moisturizer or mixing with a moisturize or other oils, it smells good, and it\'s SO affordable.  I\'m done with overpriced stuff that doesn\'t do anything spectacular.  This serum and these guys at Silver Botanicals are the real deal.',B009G51U8Q,AHQ3VEC7KHNFTJNPFGWCT4FPS37Q
