3,'This is the exact pill organizer I was looking for. There is plenty of room for pills, gummy supplements and calcium chews, with snap tight  individual sections and a sealing gasket to keep everything fresh. I especially like that each day/time is on every section instead of hieroglyphics, but the ink used seems to disintegrate with just normal wiping clean. I will probably have to replace eventually with my label maker. I have to take a lot of meds and supplements for bariatric surgery, and this is perfect. I love that you can remove a day or two to take along for when you’re not home without carting the entire thing. Thanks to Minnie Me in TN for the suggestion!<br /><br />**Revising my review because while it’s still exactly what I wanted, all of the print is disappearing from the individual sections! I have no idea why, it’s not like I’m rubbing my finger over them, just opening & closing to fill once weekly and when I get my pills daily. I’d honestly love to hear back from the company as to why they didn’t use more durable ink, protect it, or choose a different method of adding the info on.',B07D4M5FLZ,AF33P65Y44Y327OCPVYMIBDNQI7A
