1,'I BELIEVED THE COMMERCIALS, SO I TRIED IT. I HAVE AN EXPENSIVE NEW PAIR OF PRESCRIPTION GLASSES THAT GOT A SCRATCH, SO I PURCHASED THE LENS DR. AS A TEST I USED IT ON AN OLD PAIR OF SUNGLASSES THAT HAD SOME SMALL SCRATCHES. NOW, I CAN NOT EVEN SEE THROUGH THE GLASSES. I FOLLOWED THE DIRECTIONS EXACTLY. WHEN IT DRIED, THE PRODUCT PUT A MILKY FILM OVER THE LENSES. IF YOU DIP YOUR GLASSES IN A GLASS OF MILK, THEN PUT THEM ON, YOU WILL KNOW WHAT I MEAN. I NORMALLY GIVE GOOD REVIEWS. THIS TIME I DECIDED TO WARN OTHERS BEFORE THEY MESS UP THEIR EXPENSIVE GLASSES. MINE WERE SOME OLD RALPH LOREN SUNGLASSES. THEY WERE PRETTY OLD, SO I\'M NOT TOO UPSET. GOOD THINK I DID A TEST FIRST. MY ADVICE IS, THINK BEFORE YOU BUY THIS AND TEST IT OUT BEFORE YOU RUIN YOUR GOOD GLASSES.',B000AJGP1E,AHBOPOCMEZPSNPNZ5VIP3TXR4B2A
4,'I was gifted a Clairsonic a few years ago after wanting one for awhile. I liked it but not enough to pay the exorbitant price for replacement brush heads after my spare one fell in the toilet. Lol. I couldn\'t believe the prices and none of the generic versions had good reviews.  So it\'s sat languishing in a drawer until I happened to see this collection of 4 that was a great price with great reviews.  I\'d almost decided to donate or trash the Clairsonic but decided to try these first. I\'m so glad I did! I got 4 different brushes for much less than 1 authentic replacement. They fit perfectly too. So far the quality seems just as good. The only thing that I wish they\'d done differently was to label the heads so I could tell which is which without having to come back to the Amazon listing to see.',B08L3BG82Z,AFQOJDMSSCCEN5YTZ2XY6XFVLRIA
4,'Product worked as advertised. Easy to use.',B01BN5POQ0,AEJX6YLWAGGAQQMABTCUOIUGZOAQ
1,'I cannot believe I fell for such a cheap product. It is a piece of ribbon cut off a spool and sewn to a plastic. I could have made all of these for much less than what I paid.  I totally did not check the product when it came in because my kids were delayed in returning to school, so I stuffed the package to the side.  One month later I open the package and realize I\'ve bought ribbon pieces.<br />They claim \"【Adjustable】: Once size fits all, it can be cut short to suit different people.<br />-So you expect me to cut the ribbon and resew it?  Because this is not adjustable at all.<br />They claim【What you will get】: 8pcs of face cover lanyard. Keep your face cover in reach at all times.<br />-Face cover lanyard = ribbon pieces??<br />They claim 【Durable】: The material of the braided rope is very strong, it will become a part of you, worn on the neck like nothing.<br />-Braided rope???  It\'s ribbon, not rope! Completely false advertising as ribbon is NOT rope.',B08FD8ZCY3,AFRQ6YPDKA2GJDJFHSC6NFTITPNQ
