5,'I was very pleased to find this product as it\'s in a softgel that I can take!  Can no longer take cellulose capsules as the source of the cellulose used for supplements, makes me sick now.  That\'s generally wood pulp from pine or spruce, or so I\'ve read, and sometimes poplar.  But what\'s even more interesting is this...<br /><br />Shortly (just a few days) after taking this Resvida product, I began remembering that I had dreams.  Couldn\'t remember the dreams themselves only that I had them.  I upped this brand\'s Resveratrol to 2 per day, suddenly I was remembering what happened in the dreams themselves.  I haven\'t been able to do that in many years, so I know that the product is affecting my brain in a positive way!  Can\'t wait to see what other brain improvements there are from taking them a little longer.<br /><br />A surprise benefit was that it helped me with a balance problem.  I didn\'t read that it does that trick until AFTER it helped me that way!  Thank you Resvida!',B003Y7TSK4,AFPZT3I2QHKEPUN2WZEG4VFDRCSQ
