4,'From the reviews I’ve read, I thought the green masks I’ve ordered wouldn’t have been a flimsy cotton material like the other colors people have ordered & complained about. If I knew, I would have just ordered the cheaper colored ones. But...<br />As for the quality of the masks, they aren’t bad. Stitching seems good. Seems to fit different shaped/sized faces too which I like. Do love the color. Fits comfortably on my ears. Soft & softer after Ive washed them. Just a simple mask to wear to keep distance when outdoors.',B08GZNMRTF,AHETKAFX3QRYTG6J4ZELR2NEG2NQ
