5,'I got this for my boyfriend and he loves it! It blocks out all light and sound. It doesn\'t rest on is eyeballs, like other mask do, due to the elevated eye cut outs. He and control the volume either on his phone or the mask itself. Battery life is great! He can go two to three nights without charging it. The one main downside are the small speakers. He loves because they block out sound, but due to the location and size, they sometimes hurt his ears. Overall i say you get your money\'s worth when buying this.',B08C7L5WLL,AEATSZ4YZL4XQVXJLZEZDPNKMJ2Q
