5,'This is my favorite white noise machine. I used to use a fan but they would get dusty and gross. This is portable, doesn\'t get dusty and doesn\'t blow air around the room which is a downside to fans. This one was actually purchased for my baby\'s nursery and she has already been &#34;trained&#34; to get ready for bed when this gets turned on. I don\'t care what people say, white noise is the best.<br /><br />PS - I would buy this one again over the dual speed one. i bought that one for my room a while ago, and it\'s great, but I leave it on the same setting every single night. Not worth the extra $$ IMO',B000LQI2S0,AHHRV62CZKLJ22M2GR6KB5M2TBZQ
