1,'I bought this directly from their site but wanted to leave a review everywhere for other people like me.<br /><br />I got the watermelon flavor and was excited because it smelled great, even came with a shaker bottle...<br /><br />Fast forward. I thought I was going to throw up drinking it. I held my nose to finish it off. When I got to the gym I had to use the bathroom. Nothing new there. I started working out and became EXTREMELY nauseous, so I went back to the bathroom. My body started shaking and the pain in my stomach was super intense. I\'m still shaking and can\'t even get back to my workout.<br /><br />I use pre-workout every day, but I ran out. C4 is okay,, Bucked Up is excellent, but I decided to try something new. Wrong choice there.<br /><br />If you\'re shopping for pre-workout try the Bucked Up free trial. I\'ve been using it for a year and never should\'ve tried another product. Because of this foolishness I\'m reluctant to try anything else again.',B087QR1BNV,AGTTHUQLVMVUSGHO7LT2F6ESOBLA
