4,'My podiatrist recommended this insole for my heel spur/plantar fasciitis.  I have a medium arch and most over the counter insoles don\'t give me enough arch support.  My PT said the Sole insole didn\'t quite hold my arch, so I followed the directions to heat and had my bf mold the insole to my arch. My PT said that did help with my pronation. Hopefully, in time, my PF/Heel spur will go away.<br /><br />Only con - due to my heel spur, I wish the insole was more cushioned. It\'s very hard.<br /><br />BTW - I don\'t know the difference between the sport and active models. So I bought this sport one cuz it was cheaper and had my size.',B07CQ8J65L,AH6GMNNKEZNRFDVWVPZODNRGWXFQ
