5,'I have been buying these for about a year now and although I try every vegan high protein/high fiber bar that comes on the market, these remain my favorite.  I\'ve tried all the Pegan flavors, and think the Vanilla Cinnamon Roll is by far the best.  At the manufacturer\'s suggestion, I usually microwave the unwrapped bar for 10-12 seconds before eating which softens it makes the flavor come through more (in my opinion).  The fiber content in these is excellent and I love that they contain prebiotic fiber, which is great for gut health and that they\'re not full of sugar.  Any time I eat a Pegan bar, I\'m full for hours afterward.  I only wish they were a bit less expensive, or that at least that they\'d put them on sale for us loyal customers once in a while!',B01N6ORAI0,AGTPFDNFLCR4GUMSIJD2E6KNOKAQ
