5,'We go through a lot of batteries in our house, between my boys\' portable gaming systems, MP3 players, remote controls and my wireless computer keyboard! Therefore, to save money and be kinder to our planet, we try to use rechargeable batteries as much as possible. The Rayovac Platinum Universal Charger is fantastic. It charges ANY brand and size NIMH or NICD battery, including AA, AAA, C, D, and 9V. LED indicators let you know when the batteries are charged. The whole family can bring their \"dead\" batteries over to the charger and swap them out for ones that are freshly charged. No more \"Mom, I need some new batteries!\" The Rayovac Platinum Universal Charger and an assortment of rechargeable Rayovac batteries are a \"must-have\" for every household.',B003D7LHKO,AEAMRZKE6V6BRCHHM4UO4MGITBBQ
5,'My ENT doctor recommended this to me for my sinus problems, as something I could use at work. I use another product at home that allows for a larger volume rinse, but when I\'m out and need something to throw in my purse and take with me, this is great. Just keep an eye on the adapter tip - it does come off for easier storage, but that also means you can accidentally knock it off while wiping it down.',B001IACOFK,AFBZBUYUIJLBFV76KS6J2JDZS4TQ
