3,'Very Useful for kids. Easy to clean your toddler’s mucus inside nose. my 4 year old boy didn’t even feel it when I was cleaning inside his nose. Easy to hold it. Not heavy. And Charging is really faster than I thought. The most cool thing is you can play music while you using it.<br /><br />Cons -<br />Had a little bit hard time trying to clean my new born 1 month old baby’s nose. The size of the silicone tip for newborn baby is too big.',B07XB5KYDM,AHGU26PD6AMBTH5U7CTNTTPNAWOA
