5,'After a lot of research, I decided to try this product because it is one of the only toothpastes (well, it\'s not really a paste at all but you get my point) that doesn\'t contain sucralose which I am allergic to. Cinnamon, btw, is the only flavor of Dirt that doesn\'t contain any sweetener at all (the other two contain Stevia extract just FYI). To use it, you wet your toothbrush and dip it into the glass jar and then brush your teeth. It doesn\'t foam and it turns your teeth brown -- until you rinse. Then your teeth are nice and white and feel smooth. After using it for a week, I decided to brush once with regular toothpaste again to see if I could sense a difference in how my teeth felt. The difference was negligible-- if regular toothpaste is a 10 in that category, The Dirt would be a 9. BUT... I noticed that I had fresher breath for longer after using The Dirt than I did after regular toothpaste. The Dirt never felt overly abrasive and I like the fact that I\'m no longer putting a myriad of chemicals in my mouth twice a day. The little glass jar isn\'t ideal if you\'re someone who spills stuff a lot (this stuff ain\'t cheap!). Over time, my teeth may not be as white as before simply because it doesn\'t contain whitening agents, so we\'ll see. But overall, it\'s worth trying. I\'m going to continue to use it.',B07YNX6T5F,AEOQ22WLX7SH7OALRCZMYPFCDVUQ
5,'Slow drains no more!  They work perfectly.  I strongly suggest you have some paper towels lying flat on the counter before you begin.  EVERYTHING is cleared out with this product and you\'ll need a place to dispose of the funkness each time you pull it from the drain.  I highly recommend this simple, yet ingenious product.',B08ZJFBWDH,AHT7NHPNWLIC3PUJNLN4U543TQ5A
4,'I ordered this blood pressure monitor, as my father has many health concerns, including the need to monitor his blood pressure daily.<br /><br />I found this product and it is exactly what was needed. This blood pressure monitor allows you to take your blood pressure as often as needed, in the convenience of your own home.<br /><br />I have had no issues in using it thus far. It works directly as stated, and provides you with accurate readings. I am happy with my purchase, and would recommend this product to anyone in need of something similar.',B0B9121DFX,AHIAYN5CTWEESTW52QKI4HD5RGXQ
5,'This is a high performing hair dryer. It blows out plenty of air. It has three speeds of air and three heat temperatures, plus cool air only. The heat gets pretty hot. So, watch you don\'t get it too hot for your hair or scalp. There are two attachments that you can use - the concentrated funnel and the diffuser. They attach magnetically and hold well with no worry of falling off. The concentrated funnel attachment also has two end pieces - one a comb (smoother) and one a super concentrated (styling). The only problem with these addition pieces is they are very difficult to get out of the end of the attachment. They need an indentation to grab hold of.<br />The packaging is very nice. I appreciate that it states there is low radiation. The cord seems really heavy duty. It is 8 foot long and has a GFCI plug on it.<br />This dries my hair well and leaves my hair with no or few tangles. This hair dryer is well worth it.',B09DF8VS43,AEE4KPPFV4EWFPU4KZBKYKT4AEHA
