5,'This is outstanding!<br /><br />I just moved into a four family house and as it turns out all 3 of my neighbors smoke 😳. A this point after paying movers and my security deposit and 2 months rent I’m not moving again.<br /><br />The smells kept creeping in from everywhere so I decided (since I cannot walk around spraying febreeze all day) that I needed something efficient and effective. I was already going to order more items from amazon prime and low and behold I see this cute little air purifier. It was simple, open the box and plug in the item. Within 1-2 hours I did smell any funky cigarette smoke or the dog poop! Thank you amazon for saving the day with great product finds! 💃🏾💐😘👏🏾🤗🎉',B000G2BESO,AGM3HUSBGFNYOUH7SF4MZPIP6H2Q
5,'I have been using Safe Sea products since the beginning of the company.  I have a very strong allergy to sea lice and before this product was available, after a day or two of swimming in the ocean, I had so many itching, swollen  bites, I had to stop swimming.  Moreover, the bites remained an itching, dripping problem for a couple of weeks.  I have found Safe Sea products almost eliminate this problem and I can enjoy swimming/snorkeling in the ocean again.  The only caution is to be sure you apply the Safe Sea product all over your body (and wait the 15 minutes) before you put on your bathing suit since the lice can get under the edges of your swim suit and on your ears if you aren\'t careful.  I was also very glad when the company changed their formula making it \"reef safe.\"  A great product in all of its forms!',B08MYNY6JK,AECXL5MOBWLAONH74NNYGG7R5PRQ
5,'After I ran out of the cleaner I received from my optometrist, I didn\'t know what brand of glass cleaner to get.  I purchased Flents Wipe N Clear and was sorely disappointed.  I used about half of the large bottle before saying enough is enough.  After some review and reading reviews, I decided to try this Koala Cleaner.  I received it today and immediately cleaned my glasses with it.  It works amazingly well!  I did use the included cloth that they send and I did not have streaks to fight with.  My glasses are the cleanest they have been in quite some time and I cleaned them much quicker than normal.  I did not have specks of dust to clean off either so I assume the cloth is doing as stated.  Lastly, I never noticed any smell from the spray so I\'m not sure what some of the reviewers were talking about.  Guess they are just more sensitive to odor?  This purchase is definitely worth the $8.99 and I will be buying it again when I need it.',B07T97Z7WX,AGTLCQZIN4YWB4MSXBNFKDYU4VOA
