5,'This supplement performs better than I expected.  I returned from a week of binging on tacos and beer in Mexico, swollen and with a foggy mind.  I ordered the product while I was down south and it was waiting for me when I got home.  I took it that night and I dont know if I was excited or just because I had coffee on the way home, but I was wide awake for a long time.<br /><br />The next day, I continued taking it and my productivity has been drastically increased from the week before I went on vacation.  Now it is 3 full days since I began taking it and I have fully recovered from my weight gain and still feel more alert and productive.  I only wish they would combine it with artichoke extract.  I just assumed that it was a combination, so now I am ordering the extract to combine the two.<br /><br />I am also cutting back on my coffee usage, because that just makes me normal anyways and I would like to wean myself off of it so that when I do take it- it actually works.',B007V80D3S,AF4PRUAVMX5EYZPQOL2UEH6WHJJA
