4,'[[VIDEOID:1e998c246d526bdc263a97f6615b2b10]] This device works well, is easy to understand and does everything it\'s supposed to. I read a review that stated it is loud and when you attempt to turn it to a very low volume, then it shuts off. That happened to me the first 2-3 times I tried it, then suddenly the volume worked and I was able to adjust it to a very low level. This could be some type of defect I suppose, because I would think it should work consistently every time. I wasn\'t able to sleep with any of the sounds it featured, I found them distracting, but it\'s likely just an individual thing. I sleep pretty well to the white noise sound of a fan or air conditioner, but these tunes, bird noises and unidentifiable sounds just distracted me. There were quite a few to choose from, so I would think that most people would find at least one that would work for them. It doesn\'t hold a charge, it needs to be plugged in and the cord is about 2 1/2\' long. This also makes a decent little nightlight, if you need one. For the price, I think this is a decent little unit.',B08X7D4C5Y,AF5LHZNYDAYSIO3ICRMFGB6M4BFA
