5,'This changed everything for me. I tried other seat cushions, like memory foam. They felt good for about an hour and would go flat. I\'m 260lbs and this is by far one is the best investments I\'ve made for myself. I work 14 hours a day sitting down and this helps me make it through the day. I used it for a long road trip. This is super high quality. This is a large and a little heavy cushion, not a complaint. If you work from home and don\'t have a $400 office chair, this is a must have.',B01CKMP21W,AEG35HLFIRKSDQTOULFUR4V6W76Q
5,'Pretty pleased. I searched all over here for something like this, as the usual kind I find pretty worthless. I knew something like this had to exist by now. lol And sure enough, they work really well. Now do they FEEL amazing? Not quite to be honest, BUT they DON\'T hurt. In fact, I wore some new shoes (the pair I bought these for) a few days ago without these (since I didn\'t have them yet), and they rubbed my heel all raw. It still hurts a lot. But I just put these in, and I could walk--and even dance--around in them without pain. So I put some in my daughter\'s new shoes that are about a half size too big still, and she can now wear them because they aren\'t slipping off her heels with every step. I used the thickest pair on mine, a set of beige that I also ordered that are just medium thickness on my daughter\'s, and the medium black that came in this set on another pair of new shoes of mine. I\'m going to let the adhesive set for a day or two before I try to wear them. If they don\'t stay put, I\'ll just hot glue them in place. (#hotgluerules!) But I will also update if that happens.<br />Highly recommend.',B07BB4GR36,AGFO27QLVNISCT7B35WWTNKU7KZA
