5,'I\'ve always loved the outdoors and have easily gotten blisters in the past, but when I decided to take on the challenge of walking the AVON Walk For Breast Cancer in Washington, DC in 2010, I knew I had to find something to prevent those blisters from taking over.<br /><br />I paid attention to the directions and as instructed, applied a generous amount all over my feet before putting on my shoes and socks. I walked a total of 26 miles in just 2 days using this product on my feet (re-applying maybe every 6 miles or so). Unlike many others, I walked away with NO blisters. Of course my feet and muscles were sore, but I was up and walking easily thanks to the lack of blisters that this amazing product helped with.<br /><br />I absolutely plan to purchase this product again and will be using it on all my hiking excursions this summer!',B0033PSSHG,AEVQCBL64GBICDFARGBRXEYTCIPQ
