5,'Worked like a charm, this product is amazing! My 5 year old has had wax build up for quite sometime, I bought an otoscope last year to look in her ears and even with that tool I could never see her ear drums. Her doctor wasn’t overly concerned about it so I wasn’t either. Until recently I believe it’s affected her hearing slightly. Rather than taking my daughter to her doctor where sick kids are in the waiting room, plus making a $35 co-pay I decided to spend $10 and DIY it. I filled the bottle with warm water and hydrogen peroxide. 1/2 a bottle of spraying and one wax nugget came out of her right ear. It only took a 1/4 of a bottle for the wax nugget to come loose in her left. I checked her ears with my otoscope and I can see her eardrums now! Yay! I definitely recommend this product to those with wax buildup. My child is very ticklish and sensitive but I did a couple test sprays in her ears and she finally relaxed and let me go to work. She was excited to see the wax nuggets and said she can hear A LOT better!',B07GNGZ5HM,AFDX5PMMPW7AZXCAWJX4ZVRCQGVQ
