5,'I don\'t trust 5 star reviews where the reviewer has only ONE product in their review list. Very suspicious. So that\'s why I ask you to check my other reviews. I\'m not an employee of this  seller, just an average overweight (not obese) 42 year old who recently got into serious weight training after years and years of just going in and out of gyms. This time around in my life I decided to train harder, watch what I eat and take health supplements like protein [[ASIN:B000QSNYGI Optimum Nutrition 100\% Whey Gold Standard, Double Rich Chocolate, 5 Pound]] Omega-3, a Multivitamin and a Test Booster. After taking this product I slept better, woke up refreshed (something I had not felt even in my 20\'s), could train harder with faster recovery times and an increased libido. I did not have massive muscular results but I can feel my muscles bigger to the touch. I can\'t tell how long the effects started to show up but it did not happen on the first take so I\'m ruling out a placebo effect. As the manufacturer mentioned in an e-mail exchane, there is no off cycle period with this product so you can continue to use it after the 90 day supply is over. But just in case, I\'m taking maybe a month off before moving to another testosterone brand since this product is at the moment unavailable but plan to buy once it\'s available again. I would not recommend this product to anyone under 35-40, so if you are a healthy young guy maybe you should avoid this product and let your natural test production do the work. For the rest of us who are in this age, go for it!!',B007WOSI9M,AHUKYRUT5C7WZHGPCZ2KEU6W3ZKA
