4,'Hi, I purchased this product as part of my pursuit of a supplement that will help my digestive system and maybe even help with the foul gas odors I have secondary to weight-loss surgery several years ago.  The med is an oval/caplet shape which helps with ingestion.  You have to take it on an empty stomach which can be challenging for me.  I don\'t remember pills in the early morning when I get up.  I will have to get into the habit of that to get in a second dosage if needed.  I have only taken the pills for a week or so.  I have had no side effects.  I have had a slight increase in bowel frequency, but then that is one of desired outcomes.  It has not really made my poo a weird color other than lightening it a little.  I have not seen where it has had a lot of effect on the smell yet, but it has made me a bit more regular.  Time will tell better on the other hope.  I think it is extra nice that this formula is meant for women.  That way it is supposedly targeted for our needs.  The price is very fair.  I think this is a very good option for women looking for some regularity.',B01G62NHR8,AGRXDFZKPTOFCIESFSMDYI6SBQUA
