5,'This time of year, I start to get excited... It\'s almost spring and the good weather is coming. My favorite hairstyle by far this time of year is beachy waves. And that starts with a really good hair gel. I wasn\'t sure what to expect with the Virgo hair gel because when I squeezed a little out into my hand, it was VERY thick and very dark colored. I feared with my highlights, the blue would show. And not only that, the thickness would limit my styling. However, the Virgo Active Performance Gel really felt nice going through my damp hair. And it didn\'t make it feel funny at all. I did my normal upside down blow dry, whilst scrunching my hair and it really felt amazing. It smelled really nice too. My hair held up all day long. I did get this item at a discount in exchange for an honest review, all opinions are 100\% my own.',B0181F7XJQ,AEDTAKNYLGQ5IDBKDNMAJZUJQMCA
