2,'According to the pictures, I thought I was purchasing 3 bottles of 200 test strips. I felt deceived when just 1 bottle arrived.  No other competitor leaves any question as to how many bottles are shipped - their pictures show only 1 bottle or package.  I absolutely despise companies who use trickery in their ads. In reading other reviews by people who have used other brands, it appears that all test strips are about the same so I was going for best pricing, only to find out that I paid three times the amount I expected. Secondly, It was difficult to distinguish if I tested out at 6.25 or 6.5.  The green on the color chart is tinted by olive colors while my test strips are tinted in shades of lime. The coloring for some friends who tested at lower levels was more accurate. I won\'t fall for the 3 bottle deceptive advertisement next time I make a purchase, and perhaps I will get a more accurate color chart.  [[ASIN:B01CF8CGGA HealthyWiser Ph Test Strips, Accurate Results in 15 Seconds + BONUS Alkaline Food Chart PDF + 21 Alkaline Recipes eBook - 200ct Per Barrel]]',B01CF8CGGA,AEYPFBGEVVMBYY4QS5LMZT2GVPBA
