5,'These insoles are so soft and squishy! I think they\'ll be great for inserts in shoes that she doesn\'t use for running. When they are gel it seems like they can\'t keep balanced quite as well as when they are solid material. I am pleased with the quality of this product and would recommend it to a friend in search of foot relief for their children. Kid\'s shoes these days are made so cheaply that they just don\'t seem to have the support kids growing feet need to be supported. I received this product at a discount in exchange for my honest review but my opinions are 100\% my own.',B01GK7YU0W,AECCFEIJR4HDDI2LYHQ45C2GWNCA
