4,'This straightening hair brush was a Christmas present for my 12 y/o daughter.  She absolutely loves the brush.  It is nearly as perfect as her flat iron.  It straightens hair as described when used with the correct hair care products.  I purchased Arghan hair oil for my daughter. The oil works great with the brush.  The only noticeable difference from a regular flat iron is the ends, they still have a slight curl after being brushed.  The curl is minimal.  As advertised the brush does not scorch hair or skin.  My daughter finds it faster to iron her on school mornings using the brush compared to her flat iron.  She had not had any issues as of yet with the brush.  The instructions were clear and concise, very easy for my daughter to read understand and follow without having to ask any questions. This is a good product however it is not a complete replacement for a good flat iron.  I recommend both be kept on hand.  I would recommend this product to anyone and have to family and friends.',B016YKQ4PY,AHO6TASRYXMMAU2EVAXALWBCCY6A
