5,'[[VIDEOID:b3acc6d4150600e56e01154802b12706]] I had back issues so I bought this device for primarily for thus purpose.  I\'ve been using TENS device to ease my pain but gave this one a try.  My observations below:<br />- Packaging<br />Product is securely and neatly packed with each compontents sealed properly.<br />- Design<br />Using a velcro to attach the body with the belt strap I think is a simple yet brilliant design. It\'s easy to assemble and you can easily control the tightness to the target body part<br />- Wireless connectivity and control<br />This device has a battery pack that powers the belt. I appreciate there is a dedicated pocket with usb c connector to hold the battery. It can also be charged directly with the charger.<br />Also liked there is an android you can use to control the brightness and time for eqse of usage<br />Effectiveness<br />- Too early to tell but so far, this feels good and I sense this helps to heal and relieve my back pain.  I feel relaxed after use and I see no bad effects.<br />I\'ll be regularly using this and will update this review. Overall, for the factors mentioned above, possible health benefits, and pricepoint, I think this is a keeper! It also saves me money for my chiropractor trips!',B0BVWCV7S4,AHSKE4DP3SFIITF66WHC2FZEYZLA
