2,'Pretty much the only thing I like about this mask is the size.  I am large (6\'4\"), so I have a hard time finding masks that cover and are comfortable.  This mask fits that bill.  Now the down side:<br />It\'s hot.  This is by far the hottest mask I own.  I sweat profusely under it.<br />It is not easy breathing.  I find myself actually pulling for air when I breathe in this mask.<br />The filter pocket is a joke.  The pocket goes across the whole mask, but is too big for the standard PM2 filter, so the filter slips and you don\'t have total filtration, if any.  This is something they conveniently leave off the advertisement.<br />There is no nose clip, so my glasses were constantly fogging.<br />The quality is not great.  Mine is kind of lop-sided, so when I try to get it comfortable, the ear loops pull off my ears.<br /><br />I\'m not going to be using this mask very much.  I can\'t recommend it to other people.',B08BWBQ3T3,AH6PFHI7UCZO4GBVYCKZAEQM7HHQ
5,'I bought this over a year ago and I use it every day I work. The difference with and without it is night and day! It’s easily the single best thing I ever bought for my comfort in the truck! I’m a BIG guy at 5’ 10” 320lbs, lower back pain is a fact of life. This cushion made a HUGE impact on my day to day comfort and mobility. It lessened my back pain to a point where it’s almost gone. Now that I have less pain from sitting while I’m driving I can stand and walk much easier. This thing is awesome! Nothing else I’ve tried even comes close to how well this cushion works! I’ve tried almost every cushion they sell at truck stops and department stores and nothing is as comfortable, supportive, and life changing as The Purple Seat Cushion Ultimate! I can’t say enough good things! It’s held up very well over the past year and the cover it comes with has too! I won’t leave without it now and it’s part of my daily work gear. It lives in my truck so I’m never without it! Thanks Purple for a great product!! From one happy truck driver!',B01CKMP21W,AGJDINEMBY2FMP43IYJRRSU2HWOQ
