5,'I have been using these for over a year now for my female German Shepherd. She has EPI or Exocrine Pancreatic Insufficiency. The dog cannot digest it\'s food because it lacks enzymes in the pancreas. Dogs will literally starve to death if not treated. I basically diagnosed her myself because the vet claims he did not know what was wrong with her. After getting a new vet & doing my own research I came across Bio Case online. These are so much cheaper than what the vets office will try to sell you. $25.00 a month versus $100.00 a month for the vet prescribed meds is a much better deal for the same product. I give my dog 4 pills a day with food. You just open capsules, sprinkle on food, add some water, let food sit for 20-30 minutes then feed. If I did not give my pet these everyday she would waste away & die. These capsules have helped her so much. She went from a near death 45 pounds to 60 pounds. She\'s still thin for a shepherd & probably always will be but at least she is alive & a much happier, healthier dog.',B002Q02280,AGIVHBEGFIOPJGZVM52ZZSSWC2OQ
