2,'This kit is not what I was hoping it was going to be. To start off with, they send you two guns with no instructions. Common sense tells you that, when you buy a tattoo gun from someone they should at least come with instructions on what voltage their guns run on for optimal performance. The ink cam with one of the blues leaking like a sive, and you do get a lot of color choices but at least 6 of the inks that arrived where at least half way or more dried up. So that tells me that they are not sending people fresh ink, and that it has been sitting around for awhile. I wouldn\'t suggest anyone buy this product and I\'m giving it only two stars at the moment. Whether I come back an ammend this review and change my mind will depend on how well customer service deals with the dried up and leaking ink when I contact them.',B00N2UGE32,AGXAAFAEYD63MGFEUJL3DEXOUJJA
