5,'This toothbrush works great for less than the price of ORAL-B so its a win! I like that the heads just pop on, they have a hole that you insert the base into and done. This has the standard 3 speeds with a 2 minute cycle and the interval like &#34;pause&#34; at every 30 seconds so you know to switch quadrants of the mouth to ensure even brushing of all surfaces. As with all electric toothbrushes, keep in mouth and lips shut while brushing bc you will otherwise make a little spittle mess all over the mirror! This does not feel &#34;too strong&#34; on the brush setting and the massage setting is also quite nice almost pulsing on the gums. The brush head itself is soft enough to not cause any damage or pain while brushing but strong enough to feel like you cleaned your teeth very well. This comes with a cradle that the plastic glass goes on top of for charging, you dont have to make sure anything is connected just right to charge, you just drop the toothbrush on the charger or even through the glass that sits perfectly on the charger and can either balance the toothbrush perfectly or drop it in the cup tilted to the edge of the cup and put the little travel case around the bristles and voila-no mess on the sink, it all drips down the handle if your not the kind who is going to wipe your toothbrush dry after every use (which seriously who of us actually does that every time)!<br /><br />*Disclosure: I was able to receive this product at a discounted price from the seller so that I am able to provide my unbiased opinion of this product as honestly as possible to you, the other customers at Amazon. I am providing me and my family\'s personal opinion of the item listed and these can be different from other people\'s feelings and opinions about the same product. I use the product and encourage my family to use the products and tell me how they felt as well so I can provide the best possible information to you before you make a purchase. I will only leave five stars if I adequately feel they should receive it and a seller is just as likely to receive a low rating if I feel the product is unworthy.',B01FD8KR1K,AEIEATXQSACC3ALLCF7AWAJXVGUQ
5,'I\'ve had a brass pill case for many years that was wearing out so when I went to buy a new one, I was quite disappointed to find pharmacies now only sold super low quality aluminum cases. Literally everything about them was staggeringly sub par. Figured I might as well drop the extra cash and get a good one. Not disappointed on this choice. These have good O-ring fit, every edge inside and out has been either radiused or chamfered, excellent alignment between all the parts, and good thread engagement. She seller mentions it is a fine thread but that is a relative thing. The threads are 0.8\" x 18TPI which is a good balance for this application and considering that is a very non-standard size, these were probable made on a CNC which explains the price.',B00G2SL3P0,AFBBSYKQAUUOTIJ3F6KWURZYAAJA
5,'This stuff works! you just have to follow the instructions and your feet start peeling within a week, sometimes takes a few extra days but when I expect pealing to start I start to wear socks. The peeling is kinda icky but afterwards my feet are so smooth. I would also recommend that you do not try and peel off the skin yourself, just wash them really good with a washrag or loofah when they start peeling and most will fall off then. I also avoided lotions etc. after application, it takes away from the effectiveness.<br /><br />I have used this product several times (with 3 kids my feet are usually the last thing on my mind) and each time my feet become smoother than before.',B00ECM3QTO,AHW7YC37M3EFDZGW34KSXG52L5GQ
