5,'Originally, I ordered this in the weaker potency because I heard it was used to treat tinea versicolor. I\'ve had the condition for a few years and it has grown throughout them, spreading from the top of my chest to below my belly button, in my inner elbows, and on my back. When it came in, the pellets seemed to be a little melty or something after travelling and being in the summer heat as there was a bit of film at the bottom, but the pellets were just fine. I wish it came with instructions to use them and maybe a little something personable about the company itself, but my homeopath recommended I take 3 pellets 3 times a day, and I noticed a difference in my spots (and possibly a change in my period, but I can\'t be sure. I did read an interesting thing online about the possibility of that, though)! Taking them myself and giving them to my fiance as well, the bottle lasted me a few weeks and at the end of it I decided to switch to the higher potency. Our dosage dropped to 3 pellets 2 times a day, so it\'s a little more cost-effective. I\'ve ordered this potency twice now and I\'m hoping my spots just keep disappearing!',B00OTK7FDW,AGCVOYO6WC6M4KYGVG4NC5VNNZPQ
