5,'Worth every penny 30 times over. I bought a two pack so I could use one for myself and one for my dog. Hear me out. It exfoliated my scalp, deep cleaned because my roots got greasy fast, doesn’t snag my very long/thick hair, feels great, gave volume to my roots. Even after all that honestly the best part was using it on my dog. He has dandruff (who knew dogs got dandruff?) and sheds a ridiculous amount of hair for a short/medium hair dog. This completely stopped his dandruff, dramatically reduced shedding (worth the price for this alone), made his coat shiny and healthy. This was all a bonus, I honestly only wanted it to help get the shampoo down to his undercoat. Also, it’s under $10 and you just need it.',B089JYW753,AG3H6GBW5MQDDND26AIUPUUVFTDA
5,'I attached the Hydrotac Stick-On Bifocal 1.25 Lenses on my standard sunglasses that I use for only driving. I initially wanted 1.25 strength full lenses sunglasses but was unable to find them. I did not want fully configured manufactured sunglasses with the built-in bifocal lenses because the bifocal part of the glasses is placed low for reading purposes, which do not work well for driving, because I would have to tilt my head back. However, The Best Solution I found, that meets my needs, is the Hydrotac Stick-On Bifocal Lenses. I simply attached the lenses to the Center of my Sunglasses and now I easily use them for my driving purposes without having to tilt my head back.',B06WWPTDXC,AGHAB6PDDOJMWXMYJCS6KXEI4HBQ
