1,'PROS:<br />1) The product works great for RLS and overall pain and relaxation.<br />2) It works great for sleep. 1 pump per foot, before bed, and I sleep for several hours uninterrupted. This is the biggest benefit because I am a light sleeper.<br />3) It is a great moisturizer for my feet! My feet look better and are softer after only a few weeks of using the product... I would buy it alone just for that.<br />4) I love that you know that you are getting (roughy) 30mg of mag per pump.<br /><br />CONS:<br />1) I\'d really hoped that I would not be another one who experienced an issue with the dispenser... Well, after only a few weeks of use it is not working properly.<br />2) I have no idea how much of the product is left in the bottle. The weight of the bottle feels practically the same after several uses.<br />3) I\'ve used 2-4 of pumps for a total of about 8-10 days out of two weeks of having the product... If the product is actually gone (which I have no way of knowing) then that is a terrible value.<br /><br />CONCLUSION: The product works and also is a great moisturizer. However, because of the design of both the bottle and dispenser, I will not purchase again. I do not care to play Russian Roulette with products that I need regularly.<br /><br />1 Star because no matter how good the product is, it does not matter if I cannot use it properly.',B06XXP8YRL,AEE2XN2A4S5UXQJZHNEQMOG4RAUQ
