5,'This curling wand is very nice! I like that it is a 1 inch wand and can curl my hair fairly quickly. This is not a curling iron so there is no clip at the bottom to hold your hair. After using the curling wand my curls stay in my hair for a few days until I\'m ready to wash my hair. The only product I use before curling and highly recommend is a thermal heat protectant spray to lessen the damage the heat causes to my hair. The wand heats up really fast. It would be great if it had a temperature control however it works just great and gives me the desired effect without one. I love the beautiful curls I get from using the wand. What works for me is to section out my hair before I curl. I take my hair and section it by pulling my sides up then clip the top section up. Then I do the same to the remainder pieces of my hair. I just pull my sides and clip. When I get to the last section that\'s where I start curling from the bottom of my hair up. I take about a 1 inch piece of hair at a time and wrap it around the wand for a few seconds and then release it. The heat glove that came with this is very useful it is too large for my hands but it works well enough to serve the main purpose and keeps me from burning myself while using the curling wand. I would highly recommend this curling wand.',B0130H4I2U,AFJZES2QDHWHP4YATELD4VKWGDIA
