5,'It\'s optimal to use fresh fruits and veggies for smoothies and green drinks but when you don\'t have access to fresh, this is a wonderful alternative. The nutritional profile of this powdered spinach is quite impressive! This is a good electrolyte replenisher. 3 tsps. offers 15\% potassium, 9\% calcium, 9\% vit A, 3 g protein,  6 \% sodium. The flavor is very close to fresh. It is creamy and mild and mixes easily into a drinkable liquid when added to plain water. When added to a smoothie, offers great nutrition without altering the flavor of the drink. Awesome, versitile powder which is easy to use and delicious!',B097KQY3WZ,AETWJOSRS4NUTSDQRPISYJVLWVRQ
