3,'Flavor is ok, but very strong. If I were to purchase again, I’d order direct from them where I can customize it. It is very filling and I like the benefits of it, but it seems to take some learning in how best to prepare it.<br />My main problem is that I cannot get it to stay mixed. I’m used to mixing a large protein shake and sipping it throughout the day. However, with this kind, it starts to separate after a few minutes. The first time i used it, I mixed it in a ninja blender with ice, water and instant fruit drink mix. I ended up with a layer of watery juice, layer of mixed fruit/vanilla milkiness and a layer of thick vanilla protein floating on top. Id used a clear tumbler and could see the different layers as it separated.<br />Second time i used it, I mixed it ice, water and a scoop of a coffee flavored whey protein that I’ve used everyday for years... It drank fine at first. Then about 20 minutes later it felt like it was getting oddly thick. It started to feel almost like drinking bubble tea. I poured it into another cup so I could see what was going on - I had normal shake consistency, but at the bottom of the cup was a gelatinous goo. It had the consistency of congealed pan-drippings. Eww!<br />I do actually like it, but it’s going to take a bit of trial and error to find the right stuff to mix it with so it doesn’t separate.',B01M04PZX2,AF2GDAUCNBQ44NPRWLM7XBTWAINA
