5,'Let me start off by saying my immune system is pretty great even without these gummies. But I like sugar and I like Vitamin C. Throw in \"2020\" and I figured why not inhale some Zinc.<br /><br />Anyway, here are my takeaways:<br /><br />Taste: Delicious. That almost too good but intriguing taste that makes you want to keep eating them, but you know you can\'t. It\'s a cross between jam, jelly, and purple (lol) gummy bears.<br /><br />Scent: Reminds me of my childhood. It\'s sunny, the rain just subsided, but I\'m leaving my doctor\'s office? The scent is confusing but nostalgic. If I had to sum it up, I would say it\'s a mix of lolly pops from the doctor and hard candy on a spring afternoon.<br /><br />Touch: Feels... like a cloud? I don\'t know. If you care about how it feels, just ask it. But I promise it won\'t answer back.<br /><br />Appearance: Purple.<br /><br />Sound: The gummies didn\'t answer me back. I tried.<br /><br />It might be the pandemic isolation getting to me, but I think my experience with this gummy vitamin is the same as everybody else. A love like no other. A generational romance. A moving encounter. Genuine. Funny. Tasteful.<br /><br />That\'s all I have to say. If you found my review helpful, please let me know.',B08HHTPH7F,AEC52OKGETF3ZEL2CT2RVEDGOUSQ
